<title>FRANCE: French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end Dec 96.</title>
<headline>French housing starts fall in 3-mos to end Dec 96.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures on housing starts.</p>
<p>			     3-mos to end   12-mos to end</p>
<p>				 Dec 1996	 Dec 1996</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED  (total nos)		  79,100	  306,800</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  5.3		-1.6</p>
<p> STARTED			68,400	  273,800</p>
<p> (percent)			0.0		-4.2</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING APPROVED  (sq metres)		 7.79 million	32.90 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -7.9	     -6.0</p>
<p> STARTED		     7.77 million	30.82 million</p>
<p> percent			  -1.7	     -1.3</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
